<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Hope this email finds you well. I am sorry we weren't able to connect via phone today, but I wanted to personally reach out and extend a huge <strong>congratulations on achieving Platinum One status</strong>.&nbsp;This is a remarkable milestone, and it is a privilege to welcome you to Qantas' highest level of earned recognition.<br />
<br />
As a Platinum One member, you now have exclusive access to the <strong>Qantas VIP Service Team</strong>. Whether you are at home or abroad, we are dedicated to ensuring every aspect of your journey with Qantas is seamless. Beyond managing your bookings and points upgrades, we proactively monitor your Qantas International travel, intervening where possible to minimise disruptions and keep your plans on track.<br />
<br />
<strong>Your Platinum One Advantage</strong><br />
<br />
We are delighted to offer you a suite of benefits designed exclusively for our most loyal frequent flyers including:</span></span></span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>Premium Priority:</strong> Enjoy the highest possible priority for Classic Upgrades and exclusive access to Reward seats on Qantas.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>Share the Status:</strong> Spread the benefits by gifting <strong>Complimentary Platinum status</strong> to a family member or friend.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>Exceptional Rewards:</strong> Earn up to <strong>175,000 bonus Qantas Points</strong> each Membership Year.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>Effortless Planning:</strong> We waive booking fees on all new eligible Qantas bookings.</span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>Experiences and Events:</strong> Exclusive invitations to experiences and events. Ensure your&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/ph/en/my-account/profile">VIP Preferences are up to date.</a></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><strong>Dedicated Support:</strong> Our team is available to assist you <strong>7 days a week, from 7am to 11pm (AEST)</strong>.</span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:14px;"> <span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">For a full exploration of your new privileges, please visit the </span></span></span><a href="https://www.qantas.com/">Platinum One Benefits Page</a><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your incredible loyalty to Qantas. We are honoured to be part of your future travels and look forward to providing you with a world-class experience at every turn.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Kind Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team<br />
Within Australia 1300 752 801<br />
